{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S08、S11等短停留段落里，话与多组感受交替得偏密，快速扫读不如X左右分区直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分区稳定，扫读路径更直接，但右侧感受词有时像一堆并列标签，需要观众自己拼接。Y通过加亮关键心理转折、按音乐进程呈现感受，更容易抓住每段真正发生了什么，也更清楚地连起受气、孤单、怀念、犹疑到逐渐接受的因果链。尤其是对亲近感、归属感和失去之后的复杂心情，Y的描写更细腻具体，音乐情绪的变化也更有层次，因此整体更打动人。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "34d311bc-7b38-483f-bc15-8347b75217d6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T022940870229Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.485, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:30:23.374517+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5e63c4533417d8464efab5c2c1913b75308b3ec32bbc4912ef262b8f0a9ba7dd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eed